  "reason": "The best configuration found is config_027 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) at 0.725 accuracy. Evidence strongly favors scvi_n200 over scgpt/pca, multiprofile over singleprofile, and transformer over avgpool aggregation. Among untested configs, config_030 (scvi_n200, resnet50, avgpool, weighted) has the highest expected performance based on its neighbors: scvi_n200+resnet50+transformer+weighted=0.713 and scvi_n200+imagenet_vit_l+avgpool+weighted=0.706. This experiment tests the interaction between the resnet50 image encoder and avgpool aggregation under the best RNA encoder, completing the resnet50+scvi_n200 comparison across aggregation methods. While unlikely to surpass 0.725, it is the most promising untested configuration and provides the clearest picture of whether avgpool can match transformer for the resnet50 backbone, which is the most informative use of the final experiment slot."
